{"title": "The Watersparkers", "pageid": 1321, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Watersparkers", "categories": ["Boots", "Rare items", "Sparkstruck set", "Sources of Lightning damage", "Low HP set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Watersparkers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/The_Watersparkers_Icon.png/300px-The_Watersparkers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b3/The_Watersparkers_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Watersparkers image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/The_Watersparkers_Icon.png/300px-The_Watersparkers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/The_Watersparkers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">The Watersparkers</span></a> are a pair of rare <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a> that allow the wearer to electrify water surfaces and gain <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightning Charges\">Lightning Charges</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>An enormous storm was raging the first time <a href=\"/wiki/Yrre\" title=\"Yrre\">Yrre</a> the Sparkstruck left the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Deep_gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deep gnome\">deep gnome</a>'s interest in lightning became at once an all-consuming obsession, and they would spend the rest of their years striving to recreate that storm's power themselves.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" title=\"Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/38px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/50px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boots\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 190 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  190  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ChargedLightning_ElectricSurface_Boots</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ChargedLightning_ElectricSurface_Boots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ChargedLightning_ElectricSurface_Boots\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fc9104ab-b61c-4481-8402-cecb13baf30f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fc9104ab-b61c-4481-8402-cecb13baf30f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fc9104ab-b61c-4481-8402-cecb13baf30f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Electrify_Water\" title=\"Electrify Water\">Electrify Water</a></dt><dd>When the wearer stands in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\">Water</a> during combat, it becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\">Electrified Water</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Watersparks\" title=\"Watersparks\">Watersparks</a></dt><dd>If the wearer starts their turn on an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\">Electrified Water</a> surface, they gain 3 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a>: In a gilded chest in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/38px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/50px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara's</a> area of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;339&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;41</span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Synergizes with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sparkswall\" title=\"The Sparkswall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Sparkswall\" title=\"The Sparkswall\">The Sparkswall</a>, which provides immunity to being electrocuted each round by the electrified water.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Electrify Water:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Electrify Water</b> electrifys a surface of water immediately when entering it during combat, or when standing on one as combat starts. However, it will run out in a few turns and only reactivate by leaving and entering the area of the water again.</li>\n<li>Using this in combat where friendly but non-controllable NPCs are present may result in them turning hostile afterwards if they walk through electrified water surfaces.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_watersparkers_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/The_watersparkers_dyed.png/509px-The_watersparkers_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/The_watersparkers_dyed.png/764px-The_watersparkers_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/The_watersparkers_dyed.png/1018px-The_watersparkers_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/The_watersparkers_dyed.png/509px-The_watersparkers_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/The_watersparkers_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200234\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2559/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38914/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10124/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpe